    "description": "Origin Grip (VZ-61 Skorpion) (REPACK): Laffs\n\nFirst Laffs Dynamics (Did I ever mention I feel weird using my own name in the 3rd person?) grip design for the Skorpion machine pistol / PDW.\n\n\nFour variants of the design are available:\n\n *Standard\n *Ribbed\n *Ridged\n *Padded\n\n\n\nUpdate: Added three more variants of the Origin VZ-61 Grip to the data pack for re-release. Updated recommended print settings.\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 6+\nInfill: 50%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 20%\n\n\n\nCredit: \n\nJozef Pales: Based my design off his 3D model, created a refined version of the mounting index for attachment to the VZ-61. ",
